{"version":1,"content":"<p>【故意的啦 ... 😂】大家記得上個月，備受矚目的 PlayStation 5（PS5）Linux 專案開發者 Andy Nguyen 透露，該專案賴以運作的 Hypervisor（虛擬機器監控程式）關鍵核心漏洞，被一位協助專案開發的外部人士發現並直接向 Sony 通報，導致 Sony 迅速推出韌體更新完全封堵漏洞。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T08:43:35.138839+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":159,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T08:20:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T04:57:39.766671+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T08:37:37.659139+00:00","content_hash":"1e50b4e7971250fd6d40933e313f029c3c490db96f827d8fb8bd185ad03c584e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}